# Two Locust Sprays on Ornithopter (0/2): the first leaves it -1/1 and it lives (checked as the second is cast;
# CR 704.5f needs toughness 0 or less); the second makes it -2/0 and it dies as a state-based action. The effects
# stack (CR 613.4c), and each is a separate spell, so both reach the graveyard.

